{"name":"Dreamore","dev":"Dream Voyage Inc.","keys":["ios:6447442484"],"ios":{"id":"6447442484","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dreamore/id6447442484?uo=4","rating":4.41176,"ratings":17,"price":"Free","genre":"Health & Fitness","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/67/73/ec/6773ecb5-b2b8-dc97-0293-1fff3d482a9c/eb462d38-7676-4ad6-aa9b-49ebb73a5f99_Hotpot_0.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/d1/12/a2/d112a26d-d27a-6c94-3883-b60d8b42470b/f5a565ab-dd06-4bd6-b102-58deee84b482_Hotpot_1.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/6f/aa/dd/6faadd00-16b5-c9f1-32c4-474e7fc96ac9/91909d07-cb6f-49a3-b7e2-1b0de12cf4d7_Hotpot_2.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/b2/ac/e6/b2ace66b-f7ee-253f-c470-f5860c1c2df3/638500be-ad14-4237-8ee1-0126963fcfe5_Hotpot_3.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/2f/47/da/2f47dab3-1ac3-79d1-6b4c-9d480f50d029/8fdf54dd-9cb0-4d72-bc4e-b8ffeb9b87a3_Hotpot_4.png/392x696bb.png"],"desc":"Do you ever wonder what your dreams mean or wish you could tangibly capture them? With Dreamore, you can record your dreams and receive personalized interpretations based on your unique experiences. The app uses advanced analysis algorithms to help you understand the hidden meanings behind your dreams, giving you insight into your subconscious mind.\n\nBut that's not all - Dreamore also allows you to transform your dreams into stunning works of art. Using the latest digital painting technology, you can see your dreams come to life in vivid color and detail. Share your dream paintings with friends and family, or keep them as personal mementos of your innermost thoughts and feelings.\n\nExperience a whole new level of self-discovery and creativity with Dreamore. Download now and start exploring the fascinating world of your dreams!","released":"2023-04-16","updated":"2024-01-1